    <nav class="crumbs reveal" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <a href="/work/">Work</a> <span>/</span> Sources</nav>
    <h1 class="reveal d1">Every number, its source, its status</h1>
    <p class="lead reveal d2">Each figure on this site is listed here with the property it was measured on, the window, the source, a link to evidence where one exists, and the date it was last checked. Where a value is not confirmed, the status says so instead of the number pretending.</p>
